2. Verify that Pex is correctly installed in your Visual Studio. Go to Help -> About Microsoft Visual Studio, check your version. If it is not 2017, download and install Visual Studio 2017. Pex works with this version. 

3. If your problem persists after these updates, you can run Pex by opening Visual Studio Command Prompt (Developer Tools) as an Administrator and typing the following command:--------------------}

